// PPO hyperparameters for the final stage that produced
// models/heading_hold/skill_heading_hold_goal3_alpha_guard.mpk — see
// heading_hold_stall_safe.reward.ron for the full recipe and what the alpha guard is for.
// NOT the task default; pass explicitly via --ppo-config.
//
// entropy_coef MUST stay 0.0: every heading_hold run in this lineage continues from a
// BC/PPO-converged policy, and the task file's own 0.005 default catastrophically diverges
// from such a warm start (see heading_hold_tight_tracking.ppo.ron's comment).
//
// lr = 3e-5 rather than the 1e-5 the earlier precision-tightening stages used: this stage has
// to *change* behavior (stop riding cl_max at the low-speed corner), not just polish it. A 1e-5
// pass with the same reward moved the corner barely at all, and 1e-4 overshot — it bought
// envelope-wide survival by giving up altitude tracking entirely (8.9 m tail error).
(
    gamma: 0.99,
    gae_lambda: 0.95,
    clip_epsilon: 0.1,
    value_coef: 0.5,
    entropy_coef: 0.0,
    lr: 0.00003,
    rollout_steps: 4096,
    n_epochs: 4,
    minibatch: 64,
    seed: Some(44),
)
